gent behavior locally without cloud dependencies.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-14\",\n    \"category\": \"AI developer tools\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Comie.dev\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/comie-dev\",\n    \"description\": \"Production context layer for AI coding agents that connects them to production infrastructure including logs, databases, and error tracking for real-world debugging capabilities.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-15\",\n    \"category\": \"code agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Graphbit PRFlow\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/graphbit-prflow\",\n    \"description\": \"AI-powered code reviewer for pull requests that catches issues that traditional reviewers miss. Integrates into GitHub workflows to automate code review quality assurance.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-11\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Latitude for Claude Code\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/latitude-for-claude-code\",\n    \"description\": \"Observability and token usage tracking tool for Claude Code. Shows where Claude Code burns tokens to help developers hit API limits less frequently and optimize costs.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-13\",\n    \"category\": \"AI developer tools\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Agent FM for Claude Code & Codex\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com\",\n    \"description\": \"File manager and agent interface for Claude Code and Codex that enhances file navigation and manipulation capabilities within AI coding workflows.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-15\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"display.dev\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/display-dev\",\n    \"description\": \"Deployment platform that publishes AI agent-generated HTML behind company authentication. Enables secure sharing and hosting of agent-created web content with enterprise access controls.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-12\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Openclaw OS\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/openclaw-os\",\n    \"description\": \"Development platform that turns one-off AI chat interactions into persistent, reusable applications. Bridges the gap between conversational AI and deployable software.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-14\",\n    \"category\": \"AI development platform\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": []\n  }\n]\n",
