ion for Android users.\",\n   166→    \"author\": \"Sarah Perez, Ivan Mehta, Aisha Malik\",\n   167→    \"source\": \"Tech Media\",\n   168→    \"url\": \"https://techcrunch.com/2026/05/11/google-android-show-announcements/\",\n   169→    \"published_date\": \"2026-05-11\",\n   170→    \"topics\": [\n   171→      \"google\",\n   172→      \"android\",\n   173→      \"vibe-coding\",\n   174→      \"widgets\",\n   175→      \"ai-generated-content\"\n   176→    ],\n   177→    \"type\": \"news\"\n   178→  },\n   179→  {\n   180→    \"title\": \"The Changelog: Astral joins OpenAI\",\n   181→    \"description\": \"Discussion about Astral joining OpenAI and what this signals about the center of gravity moving for developer tools. Also covered: LiteLLM supply-chain attack, OpenCode as an open-source coding-agent stack, Rust's reality check on pain points, and WorkOS pushing AuthKit into CLI auth.\",\n   182→    \"author\": \"The Changelog\",\n   183→    \"source\": \"Podcast\",\n   184→    \"url\": \"https://changelog.com/podcast/607\",\n   185→    \"published_date\": \"2026-05-10\",\n   186→    \"topics\": [\n   187→      \"openai\",\n   188→      \"astral\",\n   189→      \"developer-tools\",\n   190→      \"supply-chain-security\",\n   191→      \"rust\",\n   192→      \"cli-auth\"\n   193→    ],\n   194→    \"type\": \"podcast\"\n   195→  },\n   196→  {\n   197→    \"title\": \"A History of IDEs at Google\",\n   198→    \"description\": \"Detailed discussion about the evolution of Integrated Development Environments used internally at Google, providing insights into how a major tech company approaches developer tooling.\",\n   199→    \"author\": \"laurentlb\",\n   200→    \"source\": \"Hacker News\",\n   201→    \"url\": \"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40789234\",\n   202→    \"published_date\": \"2026-05-10\",\n   203→    \"topics\": [\n   204→      \"google\",\n   205→      \"ides\",\n   206→      \"developer-tools\",\n   207→      \"engineering-culture\",\n  