          "                 <div class=\"item\">",
          "-                    <div class=\"update-title\">",
          "-                        <span class=\"product-name\">Claude Code</span>",
          "-                    </div>",
          "-                    <div class=\"item-description\">",
          "-                        <strong>Week 19 Updates: Plugin Support & Enhanced Git Workflows</strong><br>",
          "-                        v2.1.128–v2.1.136 (May 4–8) introduces plugin loading from .zip archives and URLs, worktree baseRef configuration, auto mode hard deny rules, and hooks that see active effort level. Previous weeks brought Windows PowerShell support, ultrareview cloud code review, and project purge tools.",
          "-                    </div>",
          "+                    <div class=\"update-title\"><a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/2026\" target=\"_blank\">Devin</a></div>",
          "+                    <div class=\"item-description\">Review API & MCP Enhancements. Devin released numerous updates including Devin Review API for programmatic PR reviews, Mermaid diagram rendering, per-PR auto-review toggles, sidebar session notifications, service user permission management, MCP secret scoping, and Ask Devin in PR discussions.</div>",
          "                     <div class=\"item-meta\">",
          "-                        <span class=\"source\">2026-05-08</span> | <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new\">Release Notes</a>",
          "+                        <span class=\"tag\">feature</span>",
          "+                        <span class=\"badge badge-update\">UPDATE</span>",
          "+                        2026-05-15",
          "                     </div>",
          "                 </div>",
          " ",
          "                 <div class=\"item\">",
          "-                    <div class=\"update-title\">",
          "-                        <span class=\"product-name\">Cursor</span>",
          "-                    </div>",
          "-                    <div class=\"item-description\">",
          "-                        <strong>Cloud Agent Development Environments</strong><br>",
          "-                        May 13 updates introducing development environments for cloud agents with multi-repo support, Dockerfile-based configuration with build secrets, and improved agent-led environment setup. Also released Microsoft Teams integration and Bugbot effort level customization on May 11, followed by PR review experience improvements and parallel plan execution on May 7.",
          "-                    </div>",
          "+                    <div class=\"update-title\"><a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor</a></div>",
          "+                    <div class=\"item-description\">Cloud Agent Development Environments. Major updates introducing development environments for cloud agents with multi-repo support, Dockerfile-based configuration with build secrets, and improved agent-led environment setup. Also released Microsoft Teams integration and Bugbot effort level customization.</div>",
          "                     <div class=\"item-meta\">",
          "-                        <span class=\"source\">2026-05-13</span> | <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\">Changelog</a>",
          "+                        <span class=\"tag\">feature</span>",
          "+                        <span class=\"badge badge-update\">UPDATE</span>",
          "+                        2026-05-13",
          "                     </div>",
          "-                    <div class=\"quote\">",
          "-                        \"Claude Code vs Cursor: two philosophies, not two versions of the same thing - Claude Code is a terminal-native execution agent, Cursor is an AI-augmented IDE\"",
          "-                    </div>",
          "+                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Claude Code vs Cursor: two philosophies - Claude Code is terminal-native execution, Cursor is AI-augmented IDE\"</div>",
          "                 </div>",
          " ",
          "                 <div class=\"item\">",
          "-                    <div class=\"update-title\">",
          "-                        <span class=\"product-name\">Continue</span>",
          "-                    </div>",
          "-                    <div class=\"item-description\">",
          "-                        <strong>v1.3.38: Config Management and Security Fixes</strong><br>",
          "-                        Released v1.3.38-vscode with .continue/configs support, session history filtering by workspace directory, and critical security vulnerability resolutions. Recent versions added ClawRouter provider for cost-optimized model routing, Responses API opt-out option, OpenRouter improvements with Gemini 3 tool support.",
          "-                    </div>",
          "+                    <div class=\"update-title\"><a href=\"https://geminicli.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini CLI v0.42.0</a></div>",
          "+                    <div class=\"item-description\">Enhanced Memory & Real-Time Voice. Introduces Auto Memory Inbox to automatically capture context from executed commands and files, improved voice input with recording visualizer and output streaming, history command with timeline view and session filtering.</div>",
